  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Productive Social Safety Net Programme in Tanzania Phase II &amp; III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the Productive Social Safety Net Programme - Phase II &amp; III, which will reach 1.3m households, which are the poorest 15%, with conditional cash transfers, and green public works. The programme aims to improve the resilience and opportunities of the extreme poor by reducing the depth of the income poverty, improving food consumption and increasing their resilience to climate-related shocks. FCDO will also support the Government of Tanzania to initiate a sustainable nationwide social protection scheme.</narrative>
  </description>
